{"nodes": [{"id": "recovered_prediction_s88_item1_profile_derived_lower_profile", "label": "Derived lower profile phi(t)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S88-ITEM1-PROFILE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Generalises the constant floor of s87 to a shaped lower profile built from a sub-core's own q(r) by the SAME geometry() call the measurement uses - never from a re-interpolated density, because probe D1 showed t-grid re-interpolation of r^2 rho costs 0.8% at Z=24 3d."}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_s88_item1_profile_subcore_profiles", "label": "Sub-core profiles P1 (innermost shell) and P2 (core minus outermost)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S88-ITEM1-PROFILE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Two scored profiles bracket the ladder P_k: P1 is weakest (K' > 0.80 remains) and P2 strongest (K' < 0.15), so the certification count is bounded from both sides rather than tuned."}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_s88_item1_profile_remainder_convexity_refusal", "label": "Remainder convexity refusal (R = S~ - Phi must be convex)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S88-ITEM1-PROFILE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Probe D2 found occupied l>=1 channels carry a same-shell exchange multipole of size 0.07-0.28 in q, so S''=r^2 rho is not exact there. Rather than repair the identity the refusal is stated on the remainder: a (channel,profile) whose remainder is non-convex on the w-grid (conv_frac >= 0.999) is REFUSED, not reported."}, {"id": "recovered_prediction_s88_item1_profile_design_probes", "label": "Design probes D1/D2 declared before filing", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "recovered/PREDICTION-S88-ITEM1-PROFILE.md